WEBVTT

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.700
Sixty thousand on the right flank.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.480
Eighty thousand in the center.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.440
Sixty thousand on the left flank.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.940
Two hundred thousand total?

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.290
No way...

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:16.190
That's more than last time.

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.200
The BETA force that left the Minsk 
Hive has split into three groups,

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.860
and is proceeding through Poland.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.320
There's no distance between 
us and Berlin to our rear.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.180
There will be no retreat.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:33.720
Therefore, the army will station nearly 
all its TSFs at Fort Seelow.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:37.480
We will meet them with everything we have.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.850
Before we begin the operation, I have two 
messages concerning the squadron.

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:46.350
East Berlin
NPA Political HQ

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:46.350
Lieutenant Jeckeln will be 
staying in Berlin for a while

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:49.160
to negotiate additional forces.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:53.240
Lieutenant Pham has recovered enough 
for combat, so she will take her place.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:59.030
And we've just received word that we'll 
be joining the instructional squads.

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:05.590
At some point, we will be instructing 
troops, as well as fighting the BETA.

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:09.320
This is all thanks to the glory you've won.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.350
I'm proud of you all.

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:15.490
So I want your help once more.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:17.550
Attention, all troops!

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:22.460
The Fatherland's survival depends on this battle.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.560
We are the strongest, and we cannot 
allow ourselves to be defeated.

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:30.150
Bring down Schwarzesmarken's 
might on those damn BETAs!

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:32.180
For the Fatherland!

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:33.980
For the Fatherland!

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:39.940
Remember this. It's not that 
we trust the two of you.

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.870
One slip, and I'll shoot you right there.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:44.990
Do what you want.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:50.250
I'll prove that I'm not a dog 
of the Stasi in combat.

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.370
Your sister Lise isn't a Stasi dog.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.190
Your opinion hasn't changed?

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:35.450
I don't know.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.480
But given the circumstantial evidence,

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.850
I couldn't blame anyone who says she is.

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:42.910
Is that why you started a relationship with her?

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:47.330
Yes.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:50.360
Even if she is a Stasi dog,

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:53.090
if I'm with her at all times, I can control her.

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:57.500
Because she loves me.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:03:59.520
I see.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.260
Then I'll put you in charge of this matter.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.580
We sortie in an hour. Hurry.

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:15.770
German Democratic Republic 
Oder River's Western Bank, Fort Seelow

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.950
Destroyer-class group in front 
of the main BETA echelon

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.190
has begun to cross the Oder River.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:25.080
Estimated numbers, 
ninety-five thousand and rising.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:28.740
Special Heavy Artillery Regiment 1, 
open fire on the BETAs!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.880
How long can we hold them back?

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:35.150
This fort uses the Seelow Heights as a shield.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.960
There's no need to worry about being 
destroyed by a laser strike.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:42.380
As long as they don't make it over 
the Heights, we can hold out.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:46.960
200th, 201st ACM battalions, open fire.

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:50.260
ACM battalion signal lost.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:53.230
That's a laser strike!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.450
Impossible!

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:56.400
We should still be out of laser range.

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:59.740
Multiple shots coming from coordinate H-92.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:02.240
Much more heat than we're used to seeing.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.850
Displaying data on central monitor!

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.240
Those are...

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:10.030
Heavy Laser-classes?

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:13.380
And? Can Fort Seelow handle those?

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.180
What?

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.370
You're performing a laserjagd?

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:17.690
Which unit?

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.130
The 666th?

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:34.020
Attention, all units. Our mission 
objective has changed.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.020
We will go to eliminate the Heavy Laser-classes.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:41.600
A laserjagd on Heavy Laser-classes?

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:44.190
Can we defeat those things on our own?

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.610
Who can other than us?

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.720
Get ready, everyone.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.450
This is it.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.950
Eastern Berlin Suburbs

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:57.120
The NPA HQ is in chaos after 
the Heavy Lasers' appearance.

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.580
This has the army tied down, doesn't it?

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:05.480
I'm amazed that I was able 
to pull this situation off.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:09.090
The squad is ready to take 
control of the parliament.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:13.040
TSF Battalion Berlin, roll out.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.350
Don't let a single one escape.

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:35.360
TSF Battalion Wilhelm Kunich's 
platoon 1 has been wiped out.

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.080
We've already lost more than sixty units.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:40.930
How goes the 666th Squadron's laserjagd?

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:43.540
They're moving toward the Heavy 
Laser-classes right now.

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:45.340
Distance 3,000.

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:47.350
Lieutenant Colonel Maya,

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:54.020
there's a girl in that squadron who's the 
same age as my daughter in Berlin.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:59.400
My daughter's been weak ever since she was born.

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:03.460
She's at home, waiting for me to return.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:10.080
If the 666th fails here, 
neither she nor I will survive.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.570
Incoming message from recon battalion.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.210
The 666th has made contact 
with the Heavy Lasers.

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:25.810
The artillery from the fort is distracting them.

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:27.590
We can get close if we attack now.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:52.990
This is it!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.710
It closed its eye?

00:07:58.710 --> 00:07:59.660
No one mentioned that!

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.660
Crap!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.380
All units, back boost.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:04.500
Get away!

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:20.930
My left arm manipulator's damaged?

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.090
Brother!

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:24.100
Are you okay, Schwarzes-08?

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.470
I'm alive.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:27.980
The TSF is damaged, but I can still fight.

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:30.800
So these are the Heavy Laser-classes.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:33.240
Not only is their skin thick... 
If they can also do this...

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.050
What do we do?

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.730
There are still things we can do.

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:39.110
Everyone, use 120mm AP rounds.

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:41.680
Our target is the BETA in front that just fired.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:42.500
Support me!

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.500
Theodor!

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:04.370
Rear unit commander, report!

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.520
This is 02. We've taken out one unit.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.060
We've taken out one, too.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.570
They're not unbeatable.

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.570
Continue the attack!

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:16.210
They defeated the Heavy Laser-class?

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:18.410
No less from the Beast Numbers!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.350
Commander...

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.860
Four left!

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:56.790
All units are under 20% fuel and ammo.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.700
Squadron Captain, at this rate...

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:05.950
Anett, Theodor, you will charge and melee attack.

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:09.470
We'll do everything we can to 
support you and be decoys.

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:13.210
But know that, given our ammo, 
we can only do so for a minute or two.

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:14.410
Can you do that?

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:15.590
Yes.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.570
We can.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:17.720
Brother!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:31.250
All units, open fire!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.740
Monsters!

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.240
Two left!

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:58.190
Anett! Are you okay?

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:02.430
M-My TSF's overheated and can't move!

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.190
06, is your jump unit intact?

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:06.280
Can you fall back?

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:08.040
I-I'll try...

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.940
Fire-support ending.

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.210
No ammo!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.690
I won't let you!

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.320
This is the last one!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:23.990
What?

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.260
Irisdina!

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:45.350
Irisdina?

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:47.290
Old man! Pham!

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.530
Get Irisdina!

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:50.540
Hurry! Hurry!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:53.800
No...

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:57.670
A second wave of Heavy Lasers has appeared.

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:03.020
I expect the soldiers on the ground 
to do their utmost.

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:11.500
<i>The Stasi have begun their coup d'état?</i>

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:18.860
German Democratic Republic
Seelow Heights

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:18.660
The laserjagd is a failure.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:25.220
The BETAs still have five hundred Laser-classes 
and twenty Heavy Laser-classes.

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:27.370
Can we mount a second attack?

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.890
It's possible. But if we do,

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:33.320
the TSFs will take critical damage,

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:36.070
and going forward, we'll be 
unable to stop the BETA.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:41.110
Same Time 
Bebersee Base

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:42.640
Intel says the Stasi have begun 
a coup d'état in Berlin, as well.

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:44.330
At this rate...

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.110
Are you guys all right?

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:52.590
All units are damaged, but everyone is okay.

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:55.890
Then we can make a second attack...

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:57.880
You can't. Not in your condition.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:00.260
If we don't do it, who will?

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:01.970
Not good! Hurry!

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:09.000
Everyone, stand by for the next order.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:09.810
Right.

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:12.880
Brother, wait.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.240
Let's run away from here.

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:17.020
No one will notice if we go now.

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:21.240
We can head to Berlin and seek 
asylum in West Germany.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:22.260
Lise...

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:24.260
East Germany is doomed.

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:25.780
So please...

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:28.550
This time, come with me...

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:31.410
You're right.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:34.840
At this rate, this country will be wiped out.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:35.560
Then—

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:39.140
But I'm going to stay here 
and fight with Irisdina.

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:43.770
She saved me when I was in darkness.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:48.910
And she's still fighting to save people.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:54.100
No matter how bad it gets, she never gives up.

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:59.600
She's my last hope.

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:02.690
I want to protect that hope.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:03.860
But that's...

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:06.140
What if you die for that?

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:07.070
It's stupid!

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.860
I'm sorry, Lise.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:13.110
Then why did you sleep with me?

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:19.460
I love you so much, and you won't choose me?!

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:21.210
That's...

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:23.230
That's too cruel!

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:29.220
Once the battle's over, I'll come back to you.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:33.990
I've always loved you.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.410
So, for now...

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:43.980
More replacements units?

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:48.130
Yeah, four from a Berlin factory.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:49.610
At a time like this?

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:53.490
Our political commissar's an impressive leader.

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:57.370
I hope Four-eyes is doing well.

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:04.240
Are you insane?!

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:10.310
Ma'am, there's no other way to destroy 
the Laser-classes than a second attack.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:12.470
That's what Captain Bernhard believes.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:17.060
But a saturation strike with 
the new type of missiles...

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.850
And we use all we have?

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:22.900
If we run out now, what will 
we do if we need them later?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.650
Now is when we need them.

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:32.740
Our forces will now execute a saturation 
strike on the Heavy Laser-classes.

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:36.170
The P-270 Mosquito anti-ship missile...

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:41.550
This new type of missile can strike an enemy at 
Mach 2, and fly twenty meters off the ground.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:43.630
We'll use it to exterminate the Heavy Lasers.

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:49.050
But the plasma around the Heavy Lasers 
makes communications difficult

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.510
and precision missile-guidance impossible.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:54.430
So the ground forces, air forces,

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:57.860
and TSF units will work together to lead the BETAs,

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.810
creating a flight path for the missiles.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:06.520
The 666th Squadron will advance into the 
enemy force and guide the missiles there.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:10.830
They're trying to make their own 
version of Phoenix missiles?

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.560
The situation is dire.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:22.540
Which means East Germany must demonstrate 
that we are Europe's shield.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:28.170
Only after having done so can we deal 
with the West on equal footing.

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:30.340
What is it?

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:35.290
I believe we need to change our 
current formation for this.

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:36.020
What?

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:39.560
Anett and I should be the forwards.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:45.130
Combat with the Heavy Lasers 
involves a massive amount of strain.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:49.320
It's most logical that we heavily 
prioritize your safety.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.450
Refused.

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:54.990
We don't know what will happen on the 
battlefield, so I must take the lead.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.180
It could get you killed.

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:58.530
That's not an issue.

00:16:58.530 --> 00:16:59.980
Don't let personal feelings get in the way.

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:02.340
You're the one who's letting 
personal feelings get in the way!

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:08.470
As injured as you are, you'd sacrifice 
yourself to protect this country.

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:11.050
What's that, if not letting your 
feelings get in the way?

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:11.800
You...

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:15.640
You're this country's last hope.

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:18.650
We have a duty to protect you.

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:22.020
I agree with Second Lieutenant Eberbach.

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.820
M-Me, too.

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:27.060
We can fight because you're here!

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:31.210
I'm here because of you.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:35.070
So this time, we'll protect you.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:38.160
I don't have time to deal with your selfishness.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:38.740
Walther!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:42.270
I agree with Second Lieutenant 
Eberbach, as well.

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:43.950
Please reconsider.

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:48.750
Believe in us... In the squadron you created.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.100
Do what you want.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:01.450
We will reorganize the squadron 
before the mission.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:05.140
This plan will involve melee combat 
with the Heavy Lasers.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:07.460
Boot up all engines!

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:10.900
Exchange the 120mm rounds 
for high-speed AP rounds!

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:15.600
Swap 01's gun mounts for two long blades.

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:16.400
Hurry!

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:18.660
What about 07's spare knife?

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.430
Weld it to the back of the 
extra armor or something!

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:28.130
Sorry, Anett.

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:30.640
Huh? Oh, not at all...

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:33.890
I said something really mean to you a while ago.

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:36.090
I'm sorry. I regret it.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:37.310
Anett...

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:41.930
I'm happy to see you fighting 
to protect someone else.

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:45.340
Heavy Laser-classes sighted.

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:47.520
30 degrees to the right. Distance 24,000.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.690
Twenty of them.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.840
Okay, let's go.

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:52.190
Yeah.

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:57.070
The 666th Squadron has begun a second charge.

00:18:57.340 --> 00:19:00.360
Provisional TSF Battalion Steinhöfer

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:03.400
has begun distracting the Fort-class group.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:07.250
Begin countdown for Mosquito anti-ship missiles.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:11.480
East Berlin 
National People's Army, Political HQ

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:11.060
Signals on radar.

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:13.380
Twelve of them. We believe them to be TSFs.

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.550
So you're there, Beatrix?

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.450
Have Berlin Battalion intercept them.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:20.090
Right!

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:23.760
What was that?

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:26.340
Who are these guys?

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:27.810
Those aren't Cheburashkas!

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.820
What's wrong, Berlin?

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:31.190
Come in, Berlin!

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:32.630
Berlin!

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:51.580
Lieutenant Pham, where are the missiles?

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:53.810
Mosquitoes launched.

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:55.340
They'll hit in forty seconds.

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:57.960
Squadron Leader, we should retreat.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:01.690
No! If we want to ensure we get the Laser-classes,

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:04.220
we need to guide them until the last second.

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:07.970
First missile wave incoming!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.850
Thirty seconds to impact.

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:10.850
Twenty-nine.

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:11.850
Twenty-eight.

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:13.010
Twenty-seven.

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:15.860
Twenty-six. Twenty-five. Twenty-four.

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:19.110
Twenty-three. Twenty-two. Twenty-one.

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.940
Twenty. Nineteen. Eighteen.

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:23.860
Seventeen. Sixteen...

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:26.870
All units, back boost!

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:49.810
666th Squadron to Command.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.680
Mission complete.

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:53.590
Returning to base.

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:47.590
Well done, Theodor.

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:49.210
You're a real pilot now.

00:22:49.210 --> 00:22:51.800
Have I repaid some of my debt to you?

00:22:53.590 --> 00:22:54.860
I've decided.

00:22:54.860 --> 00:22:58.390
I'll fight with you until your battle ends.

00:22:58.390 --> 00:23:02.060
Until I make your ideals and Katia's dream real.

00:23:02.490 --> 00:23:03.530
Theodor...

00:23:05.210 --> 00:23:08.070
Iris, I...

00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:11.660
All troops, back to your TSFs!

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:15.080
Hurry!

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:16.580
Start all engines!

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:17.410
Don't move!

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:18.360
Damn it.

00:23:23.200 --> 00:23:24.050
Katia!

00:23:24.860 --> 00:23:26.360
This way! Hurry!

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:33.700
What's going on?

00:23:33.700 --> 00:23:35.330
This can't be...

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:38.270
Come out, Brother.

00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:41.860
Lise!

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:45.020
N-No...

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:50.240
Otherwise, I can't guarantee her safety.

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:55.750
<b>To Be Continued</b>
